Package: devuan-xfce-assets
Version: @VERSION@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: devuan-xfce-setup <devuan-xfce-setup@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: bash (>= 5.0), python3 (>= 3.9)
Description: devuan-xfce-setup versioned asset bundle
 Ships a system-wide snapshot of the toolkit's static assets
 (configs/ - Darkmatter wallpapers, power-user bins, alacritty + panel
 seeds, vesktop/vscodium themes, agent skill, Firefox policy) under
 /usr/share/devuan-xfce-assets/ so scripts and /etc/skel seeding can read
 them without a git checkout. The Darkmatter themes + Zafiro icons are
 fetched at install time (scripts/lib/darkmatter-fetch.sh), not shipped.
 Data-only tweaks land here; the per-user deploy happens at install
 time via the numbered scripts.
